<title>USA: Pacific Gulf Properties sold 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Pacific Gulf Properties sold 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Gulf Properties Inc said it is selling two million common shares in an offering that began January 15 at a price of $20.50 per share.</p>
<p>It said proceeds of about $39 million will be used to complete &quot;probable acquisitions&quot; and repay outstanding debt.</p>
<p>The transaction closes on January 22.</p>
